				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T07:55:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T07:55:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さまざまな　ＨＰ♪
さまざまな　ポケモンたち♪▼
なんだか　楽しいな！　きみ
また　明日も　遊びに　おいでよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T07:55:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
